00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:46.060
- Oh, he did, yeah.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.360
- So, we're doing all of that this year.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.390
My familiy's coming, I
can't wait to get snowed in.

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:50.627
- Yes. (laughs)

00:00:50.627 --> 00:00:51.525
- [Kelly] I'm very excited.

00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:55.170
We have a video of a fish
you caught, I think, right?

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.130
- Oh, yeah, we do like a little,

